Krod Snodman is a grizzled bounty hunter, a Shuni whose face is covered in graying hair like a pug's. He is small even for his people. Across his back he carries a nodachi three times his own size, enough to reach across a clearing.

Krod grouses about having to work with "Hollywood" sorts, and keeps a month of rations on him at all times. He does not negotiate.

Krod is a member of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes Convox]] of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]].
